Villain

The Abyssal Kraken. It lives in the Kraken's Abyss and has stolen the Heart Crystal. It guards the lair and can only be defeated by a player who has collected all six items.

Map Summary

The Crystal Hall connects the rest of the caves. The Kraken's Abyss is a dead-end room reached only through Jellyfish Gardens, so it never blocks access to any item. The full map is in game_map.drawio.

Tide Pool Entrance: North to Crystal Hall
Crystal Hall: South to Tide Pool Entrance, North to Sapphire Grotto, West to Amethyst Cavern, East to Jellyfish Gardens
Sapphire Grotto: South to Crystal Hall, East to Emerald Reef Gallery
Emerald Reef Gallery: West to Sapphire Grotto
Amethyst Cavern: East to Crystal Hall
Jellyfish Gardens: West to Crystal Hall, South to Quartz Shipwreck, East to Kraken's Abyss
Quartz Shipwreck: North to Jellyfish Gardens
Kraken's Abyss: West to Jellyfish Gardens
How to Win
Start at the Tide Pool Entrance.
Move through the rooms using the commands go North, go South, go East, and go West.
Use get [item name] to collect the item in each room.
Collect all six items.
Enter the Kraken's Abyss after collecting every item to win.

Lose condition: Entering the Kraken's Abyss with fewer than six items ends the game.

One possible winning path: Tide Pool Entrance, North to Crystal Hall (Lantern), North to Sapphire Grotto (Trident), East to Emerald Reef Gallery (Shield), West, South to Crystal Hall, West to Amethyst Cavern (Pearl), East to Crystal Hall, East to Jellyfish Gardens (Armor), South to Quartz Shipwreck (Net), North to Jellyfish Gardens, East to Kraken's Abyss for the final battle.
